# Indexed-but-not-source. These are committed on purpose and still have no place
# in a dependency map: the map would draw its own bundle as a file of the
# project, and a lockfile as a node with one symbol.
#
# Not .gitignore, because these are tracked — the built map ships with the repo
# so nobody needs a toolchain to use vnodes.
src/view/static/
ui/package-lock.json
